# julia-leuven-light-green: companion to Emacs' locally maintained julia-leuven theme.
# Same background, foreground, purple cursor and green selection tint.
# Julia logo anchors: blue 4063d8, green 389826, red cb3c33, purple 9558b2.
# ANSI slots preserve the Emacs accent swaps: 1/9 blue, 2/10 red,
# 4/12 green; 3/11 and 5/13 purple, 6/14 green variations.
# Light variants darken bright accents for legibility; dark lifts them.
